  "eb4da4cb-4aa4-5a21-a6fa-936843bdfb16": {
    "questionId": "eb4da4cb-4aa4-5a21-a6fa-936843bdfb16",
    "outcome": "SUCCEEDED",
    "result": {
      "schemaVersion": "knowledge-qa-result-v1",
      "answerability": "ANSWERED",
      "answer": "不能。用户归属由固定的 issuer+audience+organization 决定，tenant 映射为 local-agentic，userId 为 IdP 稳定 sub；浏览器、展示名、用户名、**owner 请求头**或角色文字都不决定归属 [1]。业务 scope 仅来自服务端已登记的个人成员策略，并复用 knowledge/conversation/task 的 read/write 权限，不授予管理或其他用户资料访问权 [1]。",
